limitations:
- Scientific review is true only for the four specifically identified successor-science scopes and their
  five cases/seven occurrences. The other62 candidates receive complete-object provenance/technical review
  only; inherited scientific literature and whole-owner claims are not renewed.
- Passing bounded corrections are not whole-owner, role, maintained installation, merge, canonical export
